@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About heat networks - Certify your heat networks with the Heat Network Technical Assurance Scheme (HNTAS)";
}

<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
        <span class="govuk-caption-l">Add a heat network</span>
        <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">
            Heat networks and HNTAS
        </h1>
        <p class="govuk-body">In this service, a heat network includes the elements used to supply heat to one or more buildings. This includes the elements that distribute heat to individual dwellings within a communal building. </p>
        <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Network types</h2>
        <p class="govuk-body"><strong>Communal networks</strong> are individual communal buildings with or without their own energy centre.</p>

        <p class="govuk-body"><strong>District networks</strong> supply to more than one building and include the connecting elements between those buildings. </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">Each communal and district heat network must be registered separately, even if a communal network is stand-alone or connected to a district network.</p>
        <p class="govuk-body">If you are registering a district network with connected communal networks that you do not own, those communal networks must be registered separately by their owners.</p>

        <div class="govuk-!-margin-top-6"></div>
        <div class="app-button-wrapper">
            <a asp-controller="HeatNetworkRegistration" asp-action="HeatNetworkType" asp-method="GET" role="button" data-module="govuk-button" draggable="false" class="govuk-button">Continue</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>